asing decorations, or loitering around, Tresna is a place you\u2019ll never want to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1754656252\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/4216e206d9ecaa4bace67f49117bde07.poster.avif?t=1754656252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/4216e206d9ecaa4bace67f49117bde07.webm?t=1754656252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5be8e5a5b9d63df2fbff17b8fa551b18.avif?t=1754656252\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the challenge of the Endless Vault, an ancient artifact that tests merchants' skills to their limits. Prove your ambition by earning substantial gold in a single shop run, or use your earnings to power up and try again. Conquer the Vault's trials to upgrade your town, and continuously raise the stakes for even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/c2aad3d80cb4c59ca58574ce8ebec498.poster.avif?t=1754656252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/c2aad3d80cb4c59ca58574ce8ebec498.webm?t=1754656252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Live the double life of a fearless adventurer and a crafty merchant! Dive into vibrant dimensions brimming with shiny loot and pesky enemies. Grow your shop, tinker with weapons and gadgets, as well as make your mark among a ragtag community of castaways.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
